WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.125
The close-up shows the middle disc. Its gate starts to the side of the silver sidebar.

00:00:01.125 --> 00:00:02.833
The tip reaches the middle disc through the opening in the front disc.

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:04.833
The pick has turned the middle gate under the sidebar. The other two rims still hold the bar up.

00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:06.250
The middle disc stays where the pick left it. The close-up now shows the copper return bar below the stack.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.250
The ramp begins to lift the return bar towards the small notches.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.875
All three discs are held together. Only the middle gate lines up.

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:13.042
The return bar drops clear and the discs can turn separately again.

00:00:13.042 --> 00:00:14.583
The pick turns the front gate into line. The rear rim still holds the sidebar up.

00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:15.583
The rear gate reaches the other two. The silver sidebar seats in all three.

00:00:15.583 --> 00:00:16.000
The return bar engages again, this time with all three gates aligned.
